  "description": "Bring artisan authenticity, organic flow, and refined personal elegance to your creative projects with Modern Signature! Designed as a handwritten monoline script font, its smooth pen-drawn strokes feature dramatic extra-tall capital loops, bouncy baselines, and natural fluid connections. Its handcrafted aesthetic gives every word an intimate, bespoke feel that elevates branding instantly.\nPerfect for signature logo marks, photographer watermarks, boutique packaging, wedding invitation suites, romantic greeting cards, aesthetic quote graphics, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring artisan authenticity, organic flow, and refined personal elegance to your creative projects with <strong>Modern Signature</strong>! Designed as a handwritten monoline script font, its smooth pen-drawn strokes feature dramatic extra-tall capital loops, bouncy baselines, and natural fluid connections. Its handcrafted aesthetic gives every word an intimate, bespoke feel that elevates branding instantly.</p>\n<p>Perfect for signature logo marks, photographer watermarks, boutique packaging, wedding invitation suites, romantic greeting cards, aesthetic quote graphics, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!</p>",
